  "reason": "The change moves write-once turn request snapshots, sealed turn reasoning and goal skill instructions into content-addressed chat_snapshot_parts beside their rows (no generic record routes, resolved only within their conversation), folds the step ledger incrementally, validates entity updates once, saves routing prose with the step's usage write, stores the answer and turn completion in one transaction (adopting an answer an earlier Core stored), and runs bounded workspace provenance off the event loop. The selection covers the new regression module (per-step write bytes/reads, parts lifecycle, integrity and conversation scoping, no generic part routes, subagent hosts from a split parent snapshot, goal skills, killed-Core crash windows, provenance loop and bounds, storage update, ledger fold) and, whole now that #568/#565/#570/#569 made them green, the provider chat loop, chat API, subagents and their lifecycle, delivery and restart recovery, prompt-cache replay, pre-turn latency, context pruning, throughput ledger, goals and child usage charges, schedules, decisions, queue, agent messages, hooks and turn ends, workspace provenance, generic CRUD exposure, storage, deletion, export/import, reconnection, catch-up, temporary chats, media, workspace, callback webhooks and the goal/skill/hook API paths.",
  "exclusions": "Full suites are not approved and are excluded. Five selected files still have failures on pristine origin/main b4debc3 and are selected by node, excluding exactly those 7 pre-existing failures (identical on this branch): test_chat_final_synthesis_recovery.py::test_final_synthesis_recovers_from_a_nameless_tool_call_fragment, test_chat_leftovers.py::test_routing_commentary_stops_at_an_unreadable_frame_beside_a_real_call[deepseek|dsml|glm] (pre-#559 red), test_harness_provider_subagents.py::test_operator_limit_reaches_the_harness_and_is_enforced, and test_tool_catalog.py::test_call_to_an_unknown_tool_is_an_error_the_model_can_correct / ::test_discovery_limit_is_refused_without_changing_the_tools_array. No frontend, Playwright or native code changed; API response shapes are unchanged except goal skill entries carrying part_id instead of instructions, which the UI never read. No schema migration: the new entity kind uses the existing entities table.",
